T1b  the required kernel K_M: closed form, Fourier transform, asymptotics, mass dependence
======================================================================================================================
  K_M(r) = 1/[4 pi rM r sqrt(r^2+rM^2)],  rM = sqrt(G M/a0);  Khat_M(k) = F(k rM),  F(z) = (pi/2z)[I0(z) - L0(z)]
